From 18ed4c44c0bc034ac68a79a2df770f41f57b2f30 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: A2Tools-patch <patch@localhost>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 00:33:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Meter: Brave Origin above the game, shown or hidden from the
 title

A globe button in the meter's title starts the player's own Brave Origin
(with a profile of its own) and shows or hides it. A KWin rule keeps that
browser above a fullscreen game, without a frame, back where it was left;
a small KWin script minimises it, brings it back and sets its opacity
(Settings, Browser). It closes with the meter. The meter sends nothing:
Brave goes online by itself.
